<%-- Shared secondary tab bar for the unified Administration shell (Users / Business Roles /
     Permissions / Publishing Catalogue / Mark Catalogue / Category Catalogue) - included by all 6
     screens so the tab bar and active-state are always visually identical, matching the same
     pattern already established for Reports (fragments/reports-tabs.jspf) and Team (ENG-087).
     Caller sets ${activeAdminTab} (one of
     "users"/"business-roles"/"permissions"/"catalogue"/"marks"/"categories") before including this
     file.

     Users/Business Roles/Permissions/Mark Catalogue/Category Catalogue stay CEO_OWNER-only
     (AdminMvcController#isCeo already gates all five server-side; this only hides the tab, never
     the only guard) - Publishing Catalogue is shown to anyone who reached this shell at all, since
     it alone also accepts a delegated PERM_17_PLATFORM_CATALOGUE_MANAGE grant
     (AdminMvcController#catalogue's own broader check, unchanged; Mark Catalogue and Category
     Catalogue deliberately have no such delegation - ENG-092/ENG-094). Nothing here decides
     authorization - the backend re-validates every route unconditionally regardless of which tabs
     are rendered. --%>
<div class="admin-tabs">
    <c:if test="${accessClass == 'CEO_OWNER'}">
        <a class="admin-tab ${activeAdminTab == 'users' ? 'active' : ''}" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/admin/users">Users</a>
        <a class="admin-tab ${activeAdminTab == 'business-roles' ? 'active' : ''}" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/admin/business-roles">Business Roles</a>
        <a class="admin-tab ${activeAdminTab == 'permissions' ? 'active' : ''}" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/admin/permissions">Permissions</a>
    </c:if>
    <a class="admin-tab ${activeAdminTab == 'catalogue' ? 'active' : ''}" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/admin/catalogue">Publishing Catalogue</a>
    <c:if test="${accessClass == 'CEO_OWNER'}">
        <a class="admin-tab ${activeAdminTab == 'marks' ? 'active' : ''}" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/admin/marks">Mark Catalogue</a>
        <a class="admin-tab ${activeAdminTab == 'categories' ? 'active' : ''}" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/app/admin/categories">Category Catalogue</a>
    </c:if>
</div>
